1151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 838 0 R
/T (The One Year of Danantara Indonesia logo was established to commemorate Danantara Indonesia's first anniversary. It symbolizes Danantara's first journey in consolidating the nation's strategic assets, carrying the theme "One Year of Journey, One Direction" as a representation of a unified vision and a foundation for moving forward. Maintaining its authoritative, modern, and trustworthy character, this identity features an elegant, celebratory touch, reflecting one year of meaningful journeys and an increasingly solid direction.)
/E (The One Year of Danantara Indonesia logo was established to commemorate Danantara Indonesia's first anniversary. It symbolizes Danantara's first journey in consolidating the nation's strategic assets, carrying the theme "One Year of Journey, One Direction" as a representation of a unified vision and a foundation for moving forward. Maintaining its authoritative, modern, and trustworthy character, this identity features an elegant, celebratory touch, reflecting one year of meaningful journeys and an increasingly solid direction.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
