/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 841 0 R
/E (The main logo is a complete composition consisting of the number "1" as a symbol of the first milestone, combined with the Danantara Indonesia logotype. During the one-year anniversary period, this logo serves as the primary corporate identity and replaces the regular Danantara Indonesia logo on all communication touchpoints, including official social media, endorsements on entity/subsidiary channels, publication materials, opening videos, and backdrops.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [16]
>>
