<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 841 0 R
/E (The mark logo is a version of the one-year element symbol without the "Danantara Indonesia" logotype. This version is used for applications with limited space or requiring a more compact appearance, such as watermarks, small merchandise, vertical media, or minimally sized digital applications. The mark logo still follows the same proportions and visual system as the Main Logo to maintain identity consistency.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [18]
>>
